{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-19_beg",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-19",
  "title": "The Myriad Dreams",
  "storyCode": "14-21",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-19_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "dbdc74b9c89a75f4994abc60520e14092a68a7f048bc150ec9b9617bb9ef73ce",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "50_g12_babeltop_ex"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We weren't imagining it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Heaven and earth reversed in the blink of an eye.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Strange, I don't seem to feel any discomfort.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do not be distracted by any changes in the rules of the Assimilated Universe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mortals were never made to set foot in this place. There is no point in trying to judge the line between the real and unreal based on our conceptions."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Look up at the sky."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The golden ocean that Rhodes Island sailed... it's hanging above our heads?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit, I see Rhodes Island... and the churning tides."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The myriad souls call to me. They're trying to pour down and drown me—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Logos is still fighting the myriad souls..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't care how above and below change. Tell me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where's Her Highness? Doesn't seem like she's here at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Damn, this place makes me feel comfortable — that disturbing kind—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But the voice that called to me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That was Theresa's voice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...The myriad souls."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She's here. We have already found her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Enough riddles, hag!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Look with your own eyes. Other than those weird pillars, do you see any—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She stops mid-sentence.\nPillar. Tower. Myriad souls. Theresa.\nIn that instant, she understands why her soul finds this place so comforting.\nThe myriad souls have taken crimson roots here, extending to the furthest reaches of heaven."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Those white pillars..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They're Theresa's will. She's trying to stabilize the tower."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She's been watching us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Time does not flow in the Assimilated Universe, but this miracle continues to grow."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's even trying to penetrate the 'sky' that we're standing on."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Maybe it already has.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If she could break through the limits here, that means—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "...",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why are you looking at me like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I had to make sure this thing we're standing on is solid enough, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't want to get it pulled out from beneath my feet when we finally get to see Her Highness."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But this 'sky' is more than what it looks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My bombs didn't even leave a mark..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's impossible to damage this place by any physical means."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The 'limits' of this place are set by rules beyond the comprehension of Terra and incredible amounts of information."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It permits neither change nor challenge."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Could've fooled me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're hiding something. Hood was right. This tower has broken through whatever 'limits' you're talking about."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I know you have secrets that not even Hood and Bunny know about."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You've never been here, but you're strangely familiar with many things here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You hide it well on your face, but you can't fool me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W, don't—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We can't afford to waste any more time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If Her Highness has fallen asleep while waiting for us, someone has to put new batteries in the alarm clock."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "She's not as reckless as she looks, Kal'tsit.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Give me a hand, bunny. There's something I need to make sure..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I was wondering. Why would there be shadows in this hellhole, when there's no sun and no moon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She throws her flashbang upwards. Rather than fall back to the ground, it keeps going up.\nThe ball of light rises from the 'sky', flying towards the golden ocean, revealing a blurry shadow."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Over there, Amiya! That shadow that won't go away!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He's here too..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "The revenant?!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "He might attack again! Careful, Amiya!",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't sense any hostility. It's like..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He doesn't even notice us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wanna do it, bunny? I've got a score to settle with him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He must know something about this godforsaken place!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait, W!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is strange... he's not like the other myriad souls we've seen, lingering here rather than leaving..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If he's here, does it mean he's dead too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No. He's fine... in fact, he's never been better."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He's fully at peace. I can feel it. A peace filled with sorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What did Her Highness do to him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Theresa saved him, retaining the last bit of consciousness that the revenant had left."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Not only that, she has brought clarity to his chaotic mind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She cured his madness? She can do that now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't know what Theresa's state is right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Can you communicate with the revenant, Amiya?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He may hold the key to the truth."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can try..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A dark wave ripples from Amiya, touching the black shadow.\nThe shadow meanders and answers the King's whisper."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So, it is you who arrived here after all, in the end."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The indistinct shadow opens its 'mouth'. His tone is surprisingly calm, with no hint of anger.\nAn instant of clarity had arrived after millennia of torment, soothing his fury at long last."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It is no coincidence that you are here, Revenant."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Theresa saved me, preserving the fragment of soul that should have disappeared."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I merely followed her to this place... to witness the turning point of Sarkaz destiny."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where did you say Theresa... Her Highness is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She has departed to retrieve the seed from the very beginning."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The seed... Amnannam?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Isn't Amnannam already under Sarkaz control? What else is Theresa trying to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Originium created everything in this land."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It has been utilized in many ways, but no one has truly mastered it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Except.. Her Highness."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She said she would steal the fire from the source of all suffering. Our curse will become the weapon that reshapes our lives."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "An immaculate garden for the Sarkaz..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Controlling Originium at the origin...",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "After all we've been through, I think you know what this means, Doctor."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Theresa is fighting for authority over Originium itself.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The vision of Theresa and Theresis goes beyond the limits of all knowledge on Terra."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "I can't let Originium become a weapon of mass destruction.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "There are no more questions. Kal'tsit gazes at you silently. You have been through too much together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So you can talk normally, after all, not just all that crap about suffering."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I was human, once."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Hmph."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I had raged against many things in my long existence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The invasion of the Ancients, the betrayal of the Sankta, the fall of Kazdel... and my rejection by the myriad souls."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Until I came here, and learned the true nature of the myriad souls."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All I feel now is sorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And you've stopped making sense again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did you not see the myriad souls on the golden ocean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All Sarkaz struggle against the injustice of fate their entire lives. There is no release, even in death."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The myriad souls are only broken fragments of information that linger in this space, imprisoned in another manner by another will..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But Her Highness said she would purge purgatory and bring salvation to all Sarkaz..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You seem to be able to communicate with this old guy, Kal'tsit. Why don't you translate what he's saying?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is Theresa already able to modify the information within Originium?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This was her promise. Theresa keeps her promises..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Revenant's Shadow",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1340_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah, finally... Theresa."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What did you say? Where is she?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Amiya, the shadow under your feet!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shadow?\nHow could I cast a shadow when there is no light?\nNo, this is not my shadow!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Amiya looks down and sees the striding white silhouette through the 'sky' that she is standing on.\n'Sky' and 'Beyond Sky'.\nTheresa and Amiya, reflections of each other."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "'Amiya...'"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Amiya hears a whisper. She looks up, and Theresa is standing by her side.\nShe takes Amiya's hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "50_g15_origindecisivebattlefield"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Damn. The battlefield... it's changing again!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Vina, the ground... it's rumbling."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Stay at your post, Hannah! Don't get distracted!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That thing above the Shard just released some strange form of energy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If the Sighs of Kings fails—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Remain alert! Allied command is reporting at least seven coordinates where sudden changes in terrain have occurred!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Three assault ships belonging to the Duke of Abercorn reported destroyed. Communications were lost with two force recon units under the Duke of Ashworth—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Order all units to stop attacking Hill C-9."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Scatter to the sides, or we'll be swallowed by the waves of Originium."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Got it! Everyone's moving!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And we've got another really bad news."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Looks like someone's sitting on that empty throne in the Nachzehrer camp..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Nachzehrer King is back..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The fog... it's getting thicker. The Sarkaz are striking back!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Horn, you and Bagpipe coordinate operations with allied command."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're more familiar with the army's commands. The other units will support us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lose this pass, and we'll lose all the ground that we took."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Roger!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll help. I'm gettin' used to dealin' with this stuff."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Captain, look... the Gloriana. It's crystalizing quickly. The Sarkaz are besieging it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Duke of Caster is still on the ship."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Victoria can't afford to lose another duke in battle."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The sound of electrical static, then the same voice is heard over all communications channels on the Victorian side."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Static-Filled Radio",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Attention all soldiers of the alliance. This is the Duke of Caster, in command of the Gloriana."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Static-Filled Radio",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You see as I do how the Sarkaz tyrant has torn our motherland apart."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Static-Filled Radio",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The malice and barbarism of our foe merely serves to strengthen our resolve to defend our country."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Static-Filled Radio",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As long as our ships and soldiers... *Bzzt*... as long as we all do our duty..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Static-Filled Radio",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is the resolve of Parliament—and every citizen, duke or commoner, general or soldier... *Bzzt*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Static-Filled Radio",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Our foe climbs the broken bow of the Gloriana once more. Originium threatens to devour our fortress."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Static-Filled Radio",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But you have not yielded, brave soldiers! Neither will Caster!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Static-Filled Radio",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...*Bzzt* I shall step up to the frontlines and stand with you... *Bzzt* ..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Static-Filled Radio",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We stand upon Mother Victoria—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Duke of Caster..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is... is he mad?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The steam knight went mad a long time ago, Hannah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did I see that right? Did the steam knight just smash into the Gloriana?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, he smashed into the almost-crystalized Stone of the Sword and Sighs of Kings..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What is he trying to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...He wants to save his Victoria."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Even the frightened soldiers in the rear heard the unusual sound from the Gloriana.\nThe armor patrols the Stone of the Sword, trampling every Sarkaz who attempts to approach it.\nBut he could contain the spread of Originium.\n'Victoria!!'\nHe roars, he smashes the ground, but there is nothing he could do to stop the Originium from swallowing the Realmblade—\nAnd so he charged at its foe, towards the Gloriana devoured by Originium."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Originium crystals shatter. The shock sends the Sighs of Kings flying, landing at Vina's feet, before countless eyes wide with astonishment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Vina pulls out the sword that had been with her for so long.\nShe points it at the charging foe and spreading fog, not one step back.\nShe is answered by the call to charge and the sound of blasting steam."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "50_g12_babeltop_ex"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You've grown."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her tone is as gentle and mild as Amiya remembers.\nBut Amiya knows that it is not the same Theresa as the one who had once held her in her arms and told her stories all night.\nAmiya had so many questions that she had hoped to find the answer for when they met.\nBut she could not say anything, ask anything.\nTheresa would not permit it.\n..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Shh. I can hear the questions within you, Amiya."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I can't answer them. All answers, all explanations are pale and powerless."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Our reunion was the product of an accident."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Perhaps I was looking forward to this moment too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You, Kal'tsit, W... and Doctor. You stand before me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm sincerely joyful for this reunion. You feel it, don't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Why?\nShe should have been sure. She should not hesitate—\nThe one before her could not possibly be Theresa.\nWhy, then, does she look exactly the same as Theresa, not just in her appearance, but also in her expression, her eyes, and the emotions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You... you're not..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're not... Theresa..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you truly think that, Amiya?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Theresa I know would never do something like this..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Enough, Your Highness."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Damn... I came here thinking I had it thought through, but I couldn't find any words other than 'Your Highness' before that face."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I remember you...\nW."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hah. You remember me. There's no greater honor I've won in my entire career as a merc."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I would have ran up to hug you, if circumstances were any different."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But you don't know, and you don't need to know, how many times I've said goodbye to you already."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This might sound sentimental, but... you were special to me like no one ever was. You showed a wandering mercenary sights that she never thought she would see."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So, the only way I can repay you is by putting you to rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is that so...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You still call me 'Your Highness'. You still remember that I'm the King of Sarkaz."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then the only thing for me to do is to protect the Sarkaz."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "What did Theresa just do?!\nAmiya turns around to see that everything has changed.\n—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The white pillar has grown at a breathtaking rate. The immeasurable 'tower' of infinity now 'falls' at breakneck pace.\nOnly the place the she stands upon...\nOnly around Theresa is there eternal peace and silence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This tower is beautiful, Amiya."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It will continue to grow forever, breaking through all limits, and hold up the heavens for the garden that will rewrite Sarkaz destiny."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How I wanted you to see it..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But you are not permitted here. Accidents must be eliminated."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "When you stand before me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
